WEBVTT

00:00:00.587 --> 00:00:03.064
<v><b>M:</b></v> <b>What time</b> do you <b>usually have</b> lunch?

00:00:05.926 --> 00:00:07.287
<v><b>F:</b></v> At <b>half past one</b>.

00:00:10.366 --> 00:00:12.800
<v><b>M:</b></v> <b>What time</b> do you usually have dinner?

00:00:15.835 --> 00:00:17.402
<v><b>F:</b></v> At about <b>eight</b> o<b>’clock</b>.

00:00:20.461 --> 00:00:22.916
<v><b>M:</b></v> <b>What time</b> do you <b>usually go</b> to <b>bed</b>?

00:00:26.276 --> 00:00:27.845
<v><b>F:</b></v> At <b>half past eleven</b>.